# Soulcoil Viper (2/3): "{B}, {T}, Sacrifice this creature: Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield with a
# finality counter on it. Activate only as a sorcery." Turn 1 Bot1 casts Memnite and the Viper (off a Black Lotus) and plays a Swamp.
# Bot2 Bolts the Memnite on turn 2. On turn 3 the Viper has been under Bot1's control since the start of the turn and the Black Lotus (in
# the graveyard) is refused as a target; the Memnite returns with a finality counter, the Viper is sacrificed as a cost, so it is in the
# graveyard. On turn 4 Bot2's second Bolt kills the Memnite and the counter exiles it instead (CR 122.1h).

